Why This Is Asked

Tests advanced security design for multi-account data platforms, focusing on breach containment speed, tenant isolation, and precise policy controls.

Key Concepts

- ABAC with tenant tags and cross-account trusts
- KMS key rotation and per-tenant policies
- Lake Formation permissions and PrivateLink isolation
- Event-driven containment (EventBridge/Lambda) and immutable logging (CloudTrail Lake)

Code Example

```json
// Example conditional IAM policy fragment
{
  "Effect": "Deny",
  "Action": "s3:*",
  "Resource": ["arn:aws:s3:::tenant-bucket-*/*"],
  "Condition": {
    "StringNotEquals": {
      "aws:PrincipalTag/TenantID": "${s3:x-amz-meta-tenant-id}"
    }
  }
}
```

## Why This Is Asked
Tests expertise in secure cross-account data sharing architectures leveraging RAM, ABAC policies, per-tenant data classification, dynamic masking, and rapid containment capabilities with immutable auditing.

## Key Concepts
- AWS RAM for cross-account resource sharing
- ABAC with aws:PrincipalTag and session tags for tenant isolation
- MFA-protected STS AssumeRole for secure cross-account access
- Customer-managed CMKs for per-tenant encryption
- Dynamic data masking for PII protection
- Immutable audit trails via CloudTrail Lake and S3 Object Lock
- 60-second containment workflow and access revocation

## Code Example
```json
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": [
        "s3:PutObject",
        "s3:GetObject"
      ],
      "Resource": "arn:aws:s3:::data-lake/${aws:PrincipalTag/tenant-id}/*",
      "Condition": {
        "StringEquals": {
          "s3:prefix": "${aws:PrincipalTag/tenant-id}/"
        },
        "Bool": {
          "aws:MultiFactorAuthPresent": "true"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

## Why This Is Asked
Tests an advanced multi-account security pattern: tenant isolation, key management, and rapid containment in a live streaming data pipeline.

## Key Concepts
- Cross-account IAM roles with MFA
- Per-tenant CMKs and rotation policies
- Explicit trust conditions (aws:SourceAccount, aws:SourceArn, aws:RequestedRegion)
- PrivateLink/VPCE for data-plane isolation
- Immutable audit trails via CloudTrail across regions
- Breach-testing and automated containment

## Code Example
```json
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": ["s3:GetObject", "s3:ListBucket"],
      "Resource": [
        "arn:aws:s3:::tenant-${aws:userid}-data/*",
        "arn:aws:s3:::tenant-${aws:userid}-data"
      ],
      "Condition": {
        "StringEquals": {
          "aws:SourceAccount": "${aws:SourceAccount}",
          "aws:RequestedRegion": ["us-east-1", "us-west-2"]
        },
        "ArnEquals": {
          "aws:SourceArn": "arn:aws:iam::${aws:SourceAccount}:role/tenant-analytics-role"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

## Why This Is Asked
This question evaluates the ability to design a secure, cross-account multi-tenant streaming architecture with strict tenant isolation, fine-grained access controls, key management best practices, and rapid incident response capabilities in a production data pipeline context.

## Key Concepts
- Cross-account trust relationships with ABAC and MFA enforcement
- Tenant isolation across streaming data paths using account boundaries
- Per-tenant KMS keys with automatic rotation for cryptographic isolation
- PrivateLink/VPC endpoints for private, encrypted data transit without internet exposure
- Immutable audit trails using CloudTrail, S3 Object Lock, and Lake Formation access controls
- Automated breach containment workflow with sub-minute response times

## Code Example
```json
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [{
    "Effect": "Allow",
    "Action": ["kinesis:PutRecord", "kinesis:PutRecords"],
    "Resource": "arn:aws:kinesis:*:*:stream/tenant-${aws:PrincipalTag/TenantId}/*",
    "Condition": {
      "StringEquals": {
        "aws:SourceAccount": "${aws:PrincipalTag/TenantId}",
        "aws:RequestedRegion": ["us-east-1", "us-west-2"]
      },
      "ArnEquals": {
        "aws:SourceArn": "arn:aws:kinesis:*:*:stream/tenant-${aws:PrincipalTag/TenantId}/*"
      },
      "Bool": {"aws:MultiFactorAuthPresent": "true"}
    }
  }]
}
```
